# backend service base url, prod environment
#
# Empty means "same origin": the admin bundle is served by the same host that
# proxies /api to the Spring service (nginx, or Spring serving the static files).
# Set an absolute URL only if the API lives on another origin, and then add a
# matching CORS rule on the backend ("satoken" must be an allowed header).
VITE_SERVICE_BASE_URL=

# other backend service base url, prod environment
VITE_OTHER_SERVICE_BASE_URL={}
